WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Okay, the position of elder has not been finalized yet.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,530
In fact, you and I can forget about home and discuss it.

3
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:08,530
Can you tell me something important quickly?

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:11,530
Yes, this disciple recently offended a senior fellow apprentice in Yaoyuan.

5
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,530
Raise it when encountering the Yaoyuan Flag Pavilion

6
00:00:13,530 --> 00:00:15,930
I hope the elder will come forward to save the situation for the disciple.

7
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:19,530
Just like this, it's not easy to get the favor I owe you.

8
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:22,530
No chance to exchange for some cultivation materials or increase your cultivation level

9
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,330
The path of spiritual practice should be down-to-earth

10
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:27,130
The disciple is dull in talent and unwilling to ask for opportunities to advance.

11
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:29,130
Elder, let it be resolved during the rainy season

12
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,130
Disciple, I hope the elder will come forward

13
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:34,130
That's right, he has no structure and no wisdom, no more than three chapters

14
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,220
There will be no silence in this life

15
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:39,220
It’s normal to want to relax in the garden

16
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,220
But how do I feel

17
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,220
His recent progress in cultivation has been quite weak

18
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,090
It must be a mistake

19
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,090
That's all, I should come down on this matter

20
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:52,710
Just go back and wait for news.

21
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,710
Disciple thanked Elder Fang
